(When filtering the invoice list in BAT reconciliation for 'OCR failed', invoices that had actually) Tj
T* (errored during scanning \(shown with a red 'Failed' badge\) were being silently excluded — only) Tj
T* (invoices with a 'not found' status appeared. The filter now correctly shows every invoice that) Tj
T* (OCR could not process, regardless of the specific failure type. The 'OCR failed' count in the) Tj
T* (header reflects the same definition, so the badge and the filter always agree. If a filter or tab) Tj
T* (returns no matching invoices, a descriptive message is now shown in place of a blank list,) Tj
T* (indicating which filter is active and pointing to the correct tab when relevant.) Tj
